        "objective_function": "f_K(S)=max(S-K,0)",
        "constraints_handling": "Reversibility handled by adding extra result qubits; sign qubit determines whether the subtraction result is copied to the output register or zeroed out.",
        "num_binary_variables": null,
        "problem_hamiltonian": null,
        "num_ancilla_qubits": "Varies by implementation: 1 ancilla for two's-complement-with-ancilla subtraction; 0 ancilla for two's-complement-without-ancilla subtraction; additional ancilla used in time-efficient payoff and in some adder/Toffoli decompositions."
      },
